# Quality Gates and Testing Rules

These rules define how to verify WordPress Sage 11 theme changes.

## Command Source of Truth

Before running any terminal command, read:

`.cursor/project-commands.md`

Do not guess commands.

Do not invent npm scripts.

Do not assume Composer is globally installed.

Composer, PHP, and WP-CLI commands should only be treated as available inside Local's Site Shell when the website is running.

## Normal Terminal Commands

The normal Mac terminal should be used for Node, Vite, Tailwind, and frontend asset work.

Common commands may include:

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
npm run build